  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0 — BREAKING: root namespace is now ArcticGizmo.Avalonia.Palette (was Palette.Theming); update your usings. The UI-free model now ships in the ArcticGizmo.Avalonia.Palette.Core package (auto-referenced). New: consumer-registerable + pinned tokens (ThemeManager.RegisterTokens/TokenSpec), ThemeManager.Current.Rgb(token), manageFluentVariant opt-out, PaletteCatalog.Find, PaletteCodec share codes, ThemeTokens.Error alias, floating Avalonia [12.0.5,13.0.0).",
